feat: operational visibility layer — metrics, board SEO pages, alert webhooks, weekly reports

This round adds the last missing loops that turn a "working system" into an
auditable, observable business: a real-time operations dashboard, per-board
SEO landing pages, webhook-driven alerts on every settlement, and automated
weekly report exports.

OPERATIONS DASHBOARD (/api/metrics):
- lib/metrics.js: collect() aggregates from payments + referrals + support tickets
  + reconcile report; htmlView() renders a clean HTML dashboard with top referrers
  table + reconciliation status row. Accept:text/html returns HTML, otherwise JSON.
- Wired as GET /api/metrics in x402-v4.js (Cache-Control: public, max-age=60 for JSON).

BOARD SEO SUBPAGES (/board/:name):
- lib/board-pages.js: builds independent HTML pages for weiboHot / zhihu / douban /
  bilibili / tieba, each with its own canonical, og tags, ItemList JSON-LD, RSS alternate.
  Cache per-board (10min TTL) with content-hash change detection; on cache miss, fires
  maybePingSearchEngines() to re-index the new board page.
- Registered routes in x402-v4.js; unknown board slugs return 404 cleanly.
- Added to sitemap.xml as additional high-priority entries (board/weiboHot etc.).

ALERT WEBHOOKS (lib/alerts.js):
- Persistent JSONL queue (data/alert-queue.jsonl); drain loop every 10 s.
- Multi-target dispatch: Telegram bot sendMessage, Discord webhook, Slack incoming,
  plus generic ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL fallback — all fire-and-forget, never block main path.
- Formatted payloads tailored per event type: fmtSettlement / fmtRebate / fmtReconcile.
- After-settle hook now enqueues {type:'settlement', ...} on every successful payment
  so ops get instant pings when money lands (future: configurable suppression window).
- Queue persists across restarts; lost queue lines cause no data loss.

WEEKLY REPORT EXPORT (scripts/export-weekly-report.js):
- ISO week-scoped aggregation: total calls, revenue, by-tool breakdown, referral stats,
  ticket count, latest reconciliation snapshot, daily CSV rows (date, calls, revenue_usd).
- Outputs data/reports/YYYY-Www.json + .csv; --dry-run and --json-only flags for CI.
- Cron'd every Monday 05:20 (after rebate-pay and reconcile have run).
- Deploy protection list extended to include data/reports/.

AUDIT EXTENDED TO 9 STAGES (57 checks):
- Stages 8+9 now cover reconciliation invariant + operational visibility (metrics JSON,
  metrics HTML view, /board/* presence, export script existence, unknown board 404).
- Summary line updated: "商业闭环完整 ✅（9 阶段全绿）".

